@startuml ssd-heartbeat
' Reasoning: heartbeat is a recurring black-box liveness interaction. The
' platform returns current runtime state without exposing internal storage.
title BEACON - SSD - Heartbeat

autonumber

actor "Probe Runtime" as probe
participant "BEACON Platform" as beacon

probe -> beacon : Send heartbeat with runtime details
beacon --> probe : Return heartbeat result and runtime eligibility

@enduml
